import { CommunityMaintained } from "/snippets/community-maintained.mdx";

<CommunityMaintained
  name="Community TTS"
  repo="https://github.com/example/community-tts"
/>

`CommunityOnlyTTSService` is not in pipecat, and that's fine here.

```python
import os

from community_tts import CommunityOnlyTTSService
from pipecat.services.acme.tts import AcmeTTSService

tts = AcmeTTSService(api_key=os.getenv("ACME_COMMUNITY_API_KEY"))
```

<ParamField path="not_a_real_param" type="str">
  Not compared: community pages document packages outside pipecat.
</ParamField>
